WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The Library of Open Educational Resources provides teachers and learners a single place to find and edit learning materials.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A teacher is planning a lesson where they need new learning materials. They look for ideas and related materials for support

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
He looks for ideas and related materials for support

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A student working on a mechanical and production engineering degree needs to find advanced learning materials.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Peter Parent would like to help his child with mathematics but does not know where to find suitable learning materials.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A great amount of open educational resources are being produced in Finland, but they are scattered around in various places.

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
They are hard to find and using them in different situations is difficult.

8
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
The Library of Open Educational Resources is a solution for this problem. The Library provides ready-made materials to support teaching and learning.

9
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The materials are free, and using them does not require signing in (or giving any permissions).

10
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
The materials can also be downloaded, and they can be edited to better suit your needs.

11
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.000
You can also share your personal and edited learning materials for others to use.

12
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.000
This way, the materials are constantly developing.

13
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:23.000
The Library of Open Educational Resources provides teachers, learners, experts, guardians and individual improvers

14
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:30.000
one single place to share, find and edit learning materials. The open educational resources have been licensed with an open license and can be used free of charge

15
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Explore the open educational resources at www.aoe.fi  and join us!

